,"status_label":"Correction verified 2022-08-25","finding":"Child/ Caregiver Ratio - 13 or More Children: During inspection it was observed 1 teacher had 21 children ages 18 - 23m and 1 teacher had 29 children ages 2yr - 11yr (SAG 4). This was corrected when the operation called all parents to pick up children for the day.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026227391","violation_type_title":"Child/ Caregiver Ratio - 13 or More Children (26 TAC §746.1601)","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-978468-i20220812-v3","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1203-4","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-978468-i20220812","date":"2022-08-12","original_code":"746.1203(4)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-08-25","finding":"Responsibilities of Caregivers - Supervision of Children: During inspection, 1 classroom was observed with 11 children ages 18m - 23m alone in a classroom. 3 children were buckled into high chairs. 1 classroom with 15 schoolers was observed alone in a classroom watching tv. This was corrected when classes were combined with a teacher present.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026347889","violation_type_title":"Responsibilities of Caregivers - Supervision of Children (26 TAC §746.1203(4))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-978468-i20220812-v4","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-745-641","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-978468-i20220812","date":"2022-08-12","original_code":"745.641","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-08-25","finding":"AP Background check results - Must receive notification prior to allowing subject to be present at your operation: During inspection, 1 staff member was observed in the operation without a background check. The operation advised it was the staff members third day of employment. The operation closed for the day and all staff and children left. The staff file was unavailable to review.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026267377","violation_type_title":"AP Background check results - Must receive notification prior to allowing subject to be present at your operation (26 TAC §745.641)","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-978468-i20220812-v5","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1201-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-978468-i20220812","date":"2022-08-12","original_code":"746.1201(1)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-08-25","finding":"Responsibilities of Employees and Caregivers -Demonstrate Competency, Good Judgment, Self-control: The operation did not show good judgement when they accepted children that put them out of ratio. The operation did not show good judgement when leaving school age children alone in a classroom watching tv. The operation did not show good judgment when they left 11 children ages 18m - 23m alone in a classroom with 3 children strapped into high chairs. The operation did not use good judgement when allowing a new hire to work in  the operation without a background check completed.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026267376","violation_type_title":"Responsibilities of Employees and Caregivers -Demonstrate Competency, Good Judgment, Self-control (26 TAC §746.1201(1))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"}]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-978468-i20220526","date":"2022-05-26","inspection_type":"Inspection","result":"No deficiencies cited","passed":true,"violation_count":0,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905795173","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905795173","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2022-05-26","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-978468-i20220510","date":"2022-05-10","inspection_type":"Inspection","result":"No deficiencies cited","passed":true,"violation_